# L-SDF Detail: js/events
# Event Handling Contracts, Methods & Action Triggers

§ SIGNATURES [js/events/eventHandlers.js]

◈ EventHandlers
├── λ initialize(dependencies: Object) : void
├── λ handleCanvasMouseDown(e: MouseEvent) : void
│   ├── Left Click (Pin Tool)     → Place pin or select pin
│   ├── Left Click (Card Tool)    → Open Card creation modal
│   ├── Left Click (Area Tool)    → Start areaDragStart marquee or click existing
│   ├── Left Click (Text Tool)    → Open Text modal or create bubble
│   ├── Right Click (Pin)         → Open Radial Menu + Activate marquee connection hub
│   └── Right Click (Connection)  → Open Connection Edit Modal
├── λ handleCanvasMouseMove(e: MouseEvent) : void
│   ├── Pan Drag                  → appState.offsetX += dx, appState.offsetY += dy
│   ├── Marquee Drag              → updateMarqueeAnimation(), multi-select pins
│   ├── Area Creation Drag        → update areaDragCurrent dimensions preview
│   └── Connection Drag           → update connectMousePos with animated dashed line
├── λ handleCanvasMouseUp(e: MouseEvent) : void
│   ├── Area Mouse Up             → Commit area-circle or area-rect to appState.pins
│   ├── Connection Mouse Up       → Complete line connection between start and target
│   └── Pin Drag Mouse Up         → Commit new world positions and trigger saveState()
├── λ handleCanvasWheel(e: WheelEvent) : void
│   └── Cursor Zoom               → Adjust appState.scale & counter-offset screen coords
├── λ handleKeyDown(e: KeyboardEvent) : void
│   ├── Keys '1'-'5'              → Set active tool family (1: pin, 2: card, 3: area, 4: text, 5: pan)
│   ├── Cmd+Z / Cmd+Shift+Z       → AppState undo / redo
│   ├── Backspace / Delete        → Delete selected pin (removePin) or connection
│   ├── Shift + 1-9               → Change color slot of selected pin or active tool
│   └── Escape                    → Close modals, close radial menu, deselect
└── λ getMousePos(e: MouseEvent) : {screen: {x, y}, world: {x, y}}
